            <title>[LU-18652] conf-sanity test_32b: FAIL: verify quota failed</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18652</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for jianyu &amp;lt;yujian@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/8c347e4a-9aeb-4f1f-a775-c10995ff7f35" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/8c347e4a-9aeb-4f1f-a775-c10995ff7f35&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_32b failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;running as uid/gid/euid/egid 60000/60000/60000/60000, groups: 60000
 [dd] [if=/dev/zero] [of=/tmp/t32/mnt/lustre/t32_qf_new] [bs=1M] [count=40] [oflag=sync]
40+0 records in
40+0 records out
41943040 bytes (42 MB, 40 MiB) copied, 4.53382 s, 9.3 MB/s
Write succeed, but expect -EDQUOT
 conf-sanity test_32b: @@@@@@ FAIL: verify quota failed 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/110246" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/110246&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-427.42.1.el9_4.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/110246" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/110246&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-427.42.1_lustre.el9.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

